### Test the echo route
POST http://localhost:5000/api/echo
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Rishitha"
}
### Register
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Rishitha",
  "email": "rishitha@test.com",
  "password": "test1234"
}

### Login
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "rishitha@test.com",
  "password": "test1234"
}
### Me without token
GET http://localhost:5000/api/me

### Me with token
GET http://localhost:5000/api/me
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN
### Add task
POST http://localhost:5000/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN

{
  "title": "Finish maths homework"
}

### List tasks
GET http://localhost:5000/api/tasks
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN

### Mark done
PATCH http://localhost:5000/api/tasks/6ae22a53f6eeed3b51c40122
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN

{
  "done": true
}

### Delete task
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/tasks/6ae22a53f6eeed3b51c40122
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN
### Unknown route
GET http://localhost:5000/api/nothing

### Bad task id
PATCH http://localhost:5000/api/tasks/123
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN

{
  "done": true
}

### Empty title
POST http://localhost:5000/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN

{
  "title": ""
}

### Broken JSON
POST http://localhost:5000/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN

{
  "title": "oops"
